 ## Testing it on my own posts
 
 Every post on my site was vibe-written. I picked four, plus my résumé as a control, and had Claude run the full loop on copies: scan, judge, a fresh subagent per file to rewrite, up to three rounds. My lamina CLI turned each before and after into a page styled for reading, and Claude built a small viewer to compare them side by side, as a word-level diff and as a change log.
